# The version and the release notes are DERIVED from commit subjects, so a
# malformed one is a silent loss rather than a style slip: `fixed:` releases
# nothing and appears in no release notes. There is no pull request here to
# catch it - commit and push straight to `main` - so this hook is the only
# place it CAN be caught.
#
# Types come from `.releaserc.json` via commitlint.config.js. Nothing to edit
# here when the list changes.
npx --no-install commitlint --edit "$1"
